    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Mullery O’Gara are pleased to present to the market 3 Scholarstown Park. An attractive 3 bedroom red brick family home with parking to the front, side entrance and secluded gardens to the rear. Located within this ever popular development with an abundance of amenities on your doorstep. \r\n\r\nNo. 3 offers well-proportioned light filled accommodation throughout and also has the additional potential to extend further to the rear or attic should one wish in years to come. (subject to p.p)\r\n\r\nThe accommodation briefly comprises of entrance porch, hallway with understairs storage off. The Living room is to the front with open fire and glazed double doors doors leading to the kitchen/dining room at the rear of the property. The kitchen itself has a range of solid wood kitchen units, sink unit and is plumbed for washing machine. There are double patio doors off the dining providing access to the rear garden. \r\n\r\nUpstairs is equally as impressive with three spacious bedrooms, the first of which is at the rear with built in wardrobes. Bedrooms 2 and 3 are to the front of the property. The bathroom completes the internal accommodation with bath, shower attachment, w.c and whb. \r\n\r\nOutside to front is off street parking with lawn bordered by mature hedging and pedestrian side entrance. To the rear is a wonderful private garden laid out lawn in lawn with mature hedging and, patio area and timber shed for storage. \r\n\r\nScholarstown Park is an extremely popular development surrounded by a wealth of local amenities. Local schools include Gaelscoil Chnoc Liamhna and St Colmcilles National and Community school. Marlay Park with its 50 acres of paths, sporting facilities and weekend market is within 5 mins. Also close by is St Endas Park, shopping facilities at Tesco, Supervalu and Knocklyon Shopping centre and Rathfarnham village. The development extremely well served with public transport links which offer quick and easy access to the city centra, the M50 is also closeby linking further afield."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Porch\r\nTiled floor, door to hall \r\n\r\nEntrance Hall \r\nUnderstairs storage. \r\n\r\nLiving Room \r\nOpen fire with pine mantlepiece and double glazed doors to \r\n\r\nKitchen/Dining Room \r\nA range of solid wood kitchen units, extractor fan, sink unit, plumbed for washing machine, breakfast bar seating. Tiled floor and splashback. Double patio doors to rear garden. \r\n\r\nUpstairs\r\nLanding\r\nHot press with shelving and access to attic \r\n\r\nBedroom 1 (Rear)\r\nWall to wall built in wardrobes. \r\n\r\nBedroom 2(Front) \r\n\r\nBedroom 3 (Front) \r\nWood flooring. \r\n\r\nBathroom \r\nBath, shower attachment, w.c, whb, fully tiled floor and walls \r\n\r\nOutside \r\nOff street parking to front with lawn and mature hedges. pedestrian side entrance. To the rear is a private garden with lawn, mature hedging, patio area and timber shed."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "c. 958 Sqft / c.  89 SqM\r\nGFCH\r\nDouble glazed windows\r\nAmple room to extend subject to p.p\r\nQuiet mature development \r\nPrivate garden to rear\r\nSide Entrance \r\nBeside a wide variety of primary and secondary schools \r\nShopping centres closeby\r\nNumerous bus routes on your doorstep \r\nConvenient to the M50"
